# Kang, Temporal Tyrant: "Whenever Kang attacks, he connives" and "Whenever you draw your second card each turn, each opponent
# loses 1 life and you gain 1 life." Turn 3: the draw step is the first card, connive's draw the second, so Bot2 loses 1 and
# Bot1 gains 1; discarding the Lightning Bolt (nonland) puts a counter on Kang, who hits as a 4/5: Bot2 20 - 1 - 4 = 15.
# Turn 5 drains again (a fresh turn); discarding an Island gives no counter: Bot2 15 - 1 - 4 = 10, Bot1 at 22. Bot2 draws
# a second card in turn 2 (Ancestral Recall) without draining anyone.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Kang, Temporal Tyrant
Lightning Bolt
Island
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
